# Normalize line endings to LF in the repo; Git converts to the platform's
# native ending on checkout for text files. Keeps diffs clean regardless of
# which OS someone edits on, and stops the "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
# warnings on every commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
